OL,3,GNEWSARobotic boat crosses Atlantic
OL,4,Aocean unaided
OL,5,
OL,6,FA robotic boat designed by Oshen, a
OL,7,FPlymouth-based maritime technology
OL,8,Fcompany, has crossed the Atlantic
OL,9,Fentirely unaided.
OL,11,FIt said its 4ft (1.2m) long robotic
OL,12,Fsailing boat crossed the finish line
OL,13,Feast of Barbados on 13 September having
OL,14,Fset sail from Gran Canaria on 7 May.
OL,16,FOshen said the C-Star PC13 covered a
OL,17,Ftotal of 2,926 nautical miles (5,400km)
OL,18,Fand its team was the first to complete
OL,19,Fthe Microtransat Challenge of a small
OL,20,Fsailing boat independently crossing the
OL,21,FAtlantic without human intervention.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
